 "remarks": "Welcome to 18 Archer Lane, a completely renovated home tucked away on a sought-after cul de sac in Darien. Perfectly situated between the Post Road shops in Noroton and the new shops and restaurants in Noroton Heights, this home offers unparalleled convenience to train, shopping, and dining.  The pristine interior boasts a brand new kitchen & baths, wood-burning fireplace that greets you as you enter, hardwood floors throughout and a versatile bonus room! The primary suite offers a private bath and walk-in closet. With a 2-car garage and a full basement, there's ample storage and potential for further customization. Don't miss the opportunity to make this exceptional property your new home!",
